WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,860
Are you very free? Very annoying. Yes, very annoying. After talking about this,

2
00:00:05,060 --> 00:00:06,060
I will never bother you again

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,860
Also try to prevent the Su family from coming again

4
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,740
First the Meng family and then the Su family. Where did Wen Chen come from?

5
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,740
Wen Wenchen

6
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,540
Does Wen Chen’s name sound hot to the tongue?

7
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:19,130
Are you leaving now? Why are you here?

8
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:22,230
I just picked up my new car. Drop by.

9
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:36,980
You go to the car first and wait for me to chat slowly. Go there and tell me whose friend that is.

10
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:40,070
What do you want to say? Tell me on the 1st of next month.

11
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:44,070
Su Lingyun and Lu Tingfeng are engaged. You need to attend to let the outside world know.

12
00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:45,470
The Su family has no guests to bring their biological daughter

13
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,370
Grandpa also asked me to take you back

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:48,770
Find a teacher to teach you etiquette
